---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="plank.to"
  description="A configurable daily planner for autistic people, people with ADHD, and anyone who wants clear routines, optional reminders, and visual supports."
>
  <div class="container">
    <h1>A daily planner you control</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      plank.to is made for autistic people, people with ADHD, and anyone who wants a clear,
      predictable day. It helps you see your day clearly, set up weekly routines, and choose the
      reminders and visual supports that work for you.
    </p>

    <h2>What the app does</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Shows your day as a clear agenda of tasks.</li>
      <li>Repeats routines on the weekdays you pick, or every day.</li>
      <li>Offers optional reminders you can turn off or adjust.</li>
      <li>Can show the weather and suggest clothing, only if you turn it on.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Learn more</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <a href="/help/">Help</a>: how to use the app.
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="/accessibility/">Accessibility</a>: what we have built in and what we are still
        checking.
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a>: what is stored and what is shared.
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
